msgid ""
"当前NPU在Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品上支持以下常见训推后端的部署，您可以根据我们的 `昇腾镜像说明 <dockerfile_build_guidance.rst>`__ 直接获取发布的镜像，也可以根据下文进行自定义安装。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Currently, the NPU supports the deployment of the following common training and inference backends on Ascend 950PR&950DT series products. You can directly obtain the released images using our `Ascend Image Guide <dockerfile_build_guidance.rst>`__, or perform a custom installation according to the instructions below.\n"
""

